!CHECK 217207.00 | 217200.10 00 | line  3 B, C P SNOW -- CPSNOW defined p.140 line 38
!CHECK 217207.40 | 216010.50 00 | line  4 B,K INT TY -- .50 carries bit 32, so KINTTY is at .40 and a .00 would FAIL
